  "description": "Third wheeling from a distance. Hahaha, I was so proud of that one. I am so funny. That one really pissed them off. We were joined by Miss Mitchell (Hot Teacher) for the second time this year, for yet another round of The Mini Playground, which added some visual and degenerate pleasure, but a major lack of pace. I was also definitely in for my best time on The Mini Playground of all time, but wore my Mountain Trainers so I'd be forced to not run, and await the others at checkpoints. Argh. Always a good burn though, this route. Had my first housewarming afterwards too. Haha, what a rogue experience that was. Smirk emoji.",
